passages.claim:
Jeremiah wrote in a book all the evil that should come upon Babylon;
Seraiah was to read it, bind a stone to it, and cast it into the
Euphrates.

"If ye continue (μείνητε) in my word, then are ye my disciples indeed";
"if a man keep (τηρήσῃ) my saying, he shall never see death"; "they have
kept thy word."
